        Brain: {
            memories: {}
        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "badges_gte_3"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 13,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Browse the thread rack",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "thread_rack"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "rack_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Browse the loom cabinet",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "loom_cabinet"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "cabinet_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Just looking",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Third badge, is it. Then the whole counter is yours — thread rack and loom cabinet both. A record is one good thread: one pass, and it had better be the right cloth. A machine is a loom — eight passes, then the frame gives and no mender in the region may touch it. Weaver terms. They are the correct terms and the League should adopt them."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Buy the Gleam if you are going anywhere dark, which from this town is everywhere. I wove one into my Cottonee as a test and it lit the back room like a festival. The League made me log that as inventory shrinkage."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Ilyana Mossveil",
                    Label: "tier3"
                },
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "badges_gte_2"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 12,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Browse the thread rack",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "thread_rack"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "rack_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Just looking",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Two badges opens the thread rack — records, one pass each, marsh moves priced by the weight of the cloth. The loom cabinet waits on a third badge. League ordinance. I have read it twice looking for a loophole and it is depressingly well woven."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "I used to take three Oran berries for anything on my stall, and it was a better system. The League does not recognise berries as legal tender for machines. So: coin, at this counter only, under protest. Do not look so pleased about it."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Ilyana Mossveil",
                    Label: "tier2"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Just looking",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Machine counter. Yes — the barter weaver, behind League glass, taking coin. The ordinance says machines sell for CobbleDollars or they do not sell, and this town needs its counter stocked more than I need my pride. My cloth is still barter only. Forever. Ask anyone."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "No stock for you yet — under two badges I may not sell you so much as a chipped record. That part is ordinance too, and no, berries do not help. I asked. In writing. Come back with two badges and I will open the thread rack."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Elowen still tells travellers the fog is Cottonee fluff. It is fog, love. Mine sleeps behind this counter now and the fog carries on outside regardless, which I consider proof."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Ilyana Mossveil",
                    Label: "default"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "TR Draining Kiss — 1000 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_tr_drainingkiss"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_tr_drainingkiss_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "TR Mud Shot — 1100 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_tr_mudshot"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_tr_mudshot_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "TR Water Pulse — 1200 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_tr_waterpulse"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_tr_waterpulse_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Back to the counter",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "back_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The thread rack. One pass each — a record burns as it teaches, like a thread you cannot unpick. Draining Kiss for taking back what a fight costs you, Mud Shot for this entire province, Water Pulse for the routes where the road forgets it is a road. Priced by the weight of the cloth."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Ilyana — the thread rack",
                    Label: "thread_rack"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "TM Venoshock — 2400 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_tm_venoshock"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_tm_venoshock_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "TM Giga Drain — 2600 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_tm_gigadrain"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_tm_gigadrain_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "TM Dazzling Gleam — 3000 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_tm_dazzlinggleam"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_tm_dazzlinggleam_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Back to the counter",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "back_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The loom cabinet. Eight passes to a machine and no repairs — when the frame gives, it gives, and you will feel it go. Venoshock for the patient, Giga Drain for the thrifty, Dazzling Gleam for anyone planning to argue with a Dragon one day. That last one is the finest thread I stock, and I stock it grudgingly, because it outshines my own work."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Ilyana — the loom cabinet",
                    Label: "loom_cabinet"
                }
            ]
        },
